    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 8,
    "title": "Ask for missing information",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-wh-questions-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Ask for missing information",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Put a question expression where its answer would go. 谁 asks who, 什么 asks what, and 哪里 asks where. 几 usually asks for a small expected count and needs the appropriate classifier; 多少 can ask for a less restricted amount.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "老师在哪里？",
                "pinyin": "lǎoshī zài nǎlǐ ？",
                "meaning": "Where is the teacher?",
                "audio": "bcaef8b85f5ae8c61644cbffb1aaab8ee632d76b1ce88694dadd91e6b0a33bb6"
              },
              {
                "text": "谁在学校？",
                "pinyin": "shéi zài xuéxiào ？",
                "meaning": "Who is at school?",
                "audio": "75bf4c58d6f276ac6002b3a3e565945361fd8848eef4bd6f3923595f00ea66e2"
              },
              {
                "text": "你看什么？",
                "pinyin": "nǐ kàn shénme ？",
                "meaning": "What do you read?",
                "audio": "b174631d863015859d1dabcff896b11e435f837508c1e3eb4fec30ad7ad05446"
              },
              {
                "text": "你有几本书？",
                "pinyin": "nǐ yǒu jǐ běn shū ？",
                "meaning": "How many books do you have, expecting a small count?",
                "audio": "c58e2538f95c12509789b9d017b55a8be64ca468dcc84b7da5ab6789ccfc38dd"
              },
              {
                "text": "你有多少书？",
                "pinyin": "nǐ yǒu duōshao shū ？",
                "meaning": "How many books do you have?",
                "audio": "3a6ff50b310f200992609ffdf343b6b6c005e4bcdf20527c72905c580721c394"
              }
            ]
          },
